┋┋┋ ━ THE RULE, APPLIED TO A RENDERING
┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸆ § Scope runs through the renderings rather than around them. Turning a key into bytes is in; addressing those bytes to a terminal is out.
┋┋┋┋ ━ SPEC.md § Terminal
┊┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸆ in    the raster, the vector, both lattices, the
┊┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸆       tricolour, the composed line — all still files
┊┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸆ out   the iTerm2 and kitty protocols, the ANSI
┊┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸆       foregrounds, the environment sniffing
┊┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸆ The one section specified here and implemented
┊┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸆ elsewhere. It says so at the top, rather than leaving
┊┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸆ a reader to find the absence.
