┊┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸆ --style text    is byte-identical to .txt
┊┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸆ --style full    is .grid and .colour
┊┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸆ --style banner  is .txt with names from .key
┊┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸆ --style line    colourless, is .tricolour
┊┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸆ Everything emit wrote is a file, or a composition of
┊┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸆ files, and `cat` is the whole integration.
